# Cloudflare Pages redirects (P4b: the game moved from the root to
# /jack-in/). Pages cannot match a query string here, so the old game
# URLs with a query (a share code, ?stack, ?daily, a door) are sent on by
# the landing page's own script; this file carries the path-only rules.
# The old PWA's manifest, fetched by an installed app's update check:
/assets/manifest.webmanifest /jack-in/assets/manifest.webmanifest 301

# The devlog became News (2026-09-25). The feeds come first because Pages
# takes the first rule that matches.
#
# The feeds: an installed 0.1.1 PWA fetches ../devlog/feed.json for its
# in-game NEWS screen, and it goes on doing that until the player takes an
# update. Without these, its news screen goes blank.
/devlog/feed.json /news/feed.json 301
/devlog/feed.xml /news/feed.xml 301
#
# The pages (2026-09-26): /devlog/ and the four old post paths go to /news/.
# The essays were folded into the About page's History section, so there is
# no one-to-one target. Before these rules, crashthestack.com/devlog/ still
# answered 200 with the old listing and its DEVLOG nav on 2026-09-26, after
# the deploy that removed it (age: 233307, s-maxage=604800), while the
# post paths answered 404.
/devlog /news/ 301
/devlog/ /news/ 301
/devlog/* /news/ 301
